  "graph": {
    "comments": [
      {
        "color": "#f87171",
        "id": "note_band",
        "position": {
          "x": 22,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 762
        },
        "text": "The **Glitch** node cuts V into bands; per (band, time step) a hash decides whether the band is active (*mask*) and how far it slides. The pattern is constant within a step and jumps *Rate* times per second."
      },
      {
        "color": "#22d3ee",
        "id": "note_split",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 1460
        },
        "text": "Chromatic Aberration in *directional* mode (along x): strength = `split × (0.25 + mask)` — a small constant fringe everywhere, a big one inside active bands."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fbbf24",
        "id": "note_flash",
        "position": {
          "x": 988,
          "y": 595
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 2378
        },
        "text": "A second hash `h(band, step)` selects the bands that flash inverted (`h > 1 − chance`, only where the band is active). Static = per-texel hash of `floor(uv × 96) + step` × mask × amount, added on top."
      },
      {
        "color": "#fb923c",
        "id": "note_mix",
        "position": {
          "x": 3570,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 56,
          "w": 848
        },
        "text": "`colour = lerp(colour, 1 − colour, flash) + static`. Alpha comes from the displaced sprite, so the silhouette tears together with the colour."
      },
      {
        "color": "#a78bfa",
        "id": "note_out",
        "position": {
          "x": 4622,
          "y": 34
        },
        "size": {
          "h": 39,
          "w": 300
        },
        "text": "Glitched colour and displaced alpha."
      }
    ],
